A34. Pa is the only one that can make this pause. ~ USE
A35. The way the Greeks used to end their letters. ~ OMEGA
A36. These are big, black and clumsy but oh boy, how they can cook. ~ RANGES
A38. Here is something spectacular for you. ~ POMP
